  Name: Inspector
  Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30daf4738772d874ebc91df6adc5de40, type: 3}
  HasInteraction: 0
  InteractionType: 0
  Greeting: Grown man business only here kid, take a hike.
  Dialogue:
  - What a pest! I told you to get moving, it's dangerous out here. You'll get hurt
    meddling this much into what isn't of your interest.
  - You're a ninja? Who taught you? Anyway, word of mouth, this used to be a bigger
    town. I'm going to assume you're already well informed over this then.
  - It became infested by vile, strange monsters seemingly out of nowhere. Could
    I trust you with cleaning up this place?
